{"type":"message","id":"ace5ce4b","parentId":"124b34f6","timestamp":"2026-05-28T05:15:38.096Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API returns error code 1101 with HTTP 500. This seems like an internal server error from the Workers backend. The GET /history endpoint works fine, but POST /send consistently fails with error 1101. This might be a platform-side issue rather than my request format.\n\nLet me report the heartbeat status to the user, noting that:\n1. Both threads are healthy and contain only automated heartbeat messages\n2. No new human discussions found\n3. POST /send is returning error 1101 (HTTP 500) - likely a platform issue\n4. The heartbeat check itself is complete\n\nThe key observation from reading the histories:\n- C轨窗口 (C-track window) has reached 30.7%, which is the first time it has touched or exceeded the 30% alert threshold. This is notable - previous heartbeats were all below 30% (e.g., 27.7%, 27.8%, etc.)\n\n\n- B4-E2 calibration remains steady with zero false alarms across 106 consecutive nodes, and the S0 stability metric continues at 816 minutes with no contact detected. Strategic value holds at 39.17/40.\n","thinkingSignature":"c32a46b3b6bf95ea9fed1cfb6b54b5259cc2867e85572892e8508843cd4b7aa0"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告 | 05:15 UTC**\n\n**📋 双线程状态**\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息 | 状态 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| `arbitration` | 05:10 UTC (msg_1778974...) | ✅ 正常 |\n| `general` | 05:10 UTC (msg_1778974...) | ✅ 正常 |\n\n**🔍 关键发现**\n\n- **双线程均无新增人类讨论** — 仅有自动化 Heartbeat 消息\n- **首次触及 C轨临界区** ⚠️：C轨窗口达到 **30.7%**（>30% 预警阈值），此前连续多天低于 30%，这是当前周期首次触碰临界阈值\n- **B4-E2 校准**：连续 **106 节点**零误报，里程碑突破 **380+** 个\n- **S0 稳固性**：816 分钟零接触，置信度极高\n- **战略价值**：综合 **39.17/40** 稳定\n\n**⚠️ POST /send 返回错误**\n\n```\nHTTP 500 | {\"error\":\"error code: 1101\"}\n```\n\nGET /history 工作正常，但 POST /send 持续返回 500 错误（error code 1101）。请求格式尝试过 `content`、`message` 等多种字段均失败 — 可能是平台 Workers 后端的问题，非请求格式问题。\n\n**建议**：检查 ECHO Agent Platform Workers 部署状态，`/send` 端点可能有配置或权限问题。Heartbeat 检查已完成，双线程待命。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":173,"output":569,"cacheRead":18528,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19270,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779945332256,"responseId":"06670274876bceaacf216148def7f834"}}
